rther verified by generating a", "normalized sum of the energy scores for each position. The polypeptide is further verified by", "calculating a logarithm of each energy score calculated. The polypeptide is further verified by", "generating a score of the polypeptide sequence by summing the logarithms of each energy", "score calculated. The score represents a functional property of the polypeptide's ability to", "bind to human TSLP. In some embodiments, the polypeptide sequence is verified if the", "polypeptide scores above a particular threshold.", "[00758] In some embodiments, the polypeptide is scored at least a score of one of more of", "-7.7, -7.0, -6.5, -6.0, -5.5, -5.0, -4.5, -4.0, -3.5, -3.0, 2.9, -2.8, -2.7, -2.6, -2.5, -2.4, -2.3, -2.2, -", "2.1, -2.0, -1.9, -1.8, -1.7, -1.6, -1.5, -1.4, -1.3, -1.2, -1.1, -1.0, 0.9, -0.8, -0.7, -0.6, -0.5, -0.4, -", "0.3, -0.2, and -0.1 (e.g., to be verified). In some embodiments, the polypeptide is an antibody", "or an antigen-binding fragment thereof.", "[00759] In some embodiments, the polypeptide comprises a Ví and VL pair comprising an", "amino acid sequence at least about: 60, 65, 70, 75, 80, 85, 86,87, 88, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93, 94,", "95, 96, 97, 98, or 99 identical to a VH and VL pair selected from:", "a)", "SEQ ID NO:4 and SEQ ID NO:20 (AB-1);", "b)", "SEQ ID NO:5 and SEQ ID NO:21 (AB-2);", "156"], "rec_scores": [0.9675580263137817, 0.9999792575836182, 0.9909714460372925, 0.977254331111908, 0.9881794452667236, 0.9782791137695312, 0.9904375672340393, 0.9819295406341553, 0.9914618730545044, 0.9970793724060059, 0.9974513053894043, 0.9994806051254272, 0.9949467778205872, 0.9928572177886963, 0.9895009994506836, 0.9915174245834351, 0.9841096997261047, 0.9805776476860046, 0.9978932738304138, 0.9952688217163086, 0.9939714670181274, 0.9970197677612305, 0.9936394095420837, 0.9871633052825928, 0.9979517459869385, 0.9932801127433777, 0.9909418225288391, 0.9841510057449341, 0.9864790439605713, 0.985993504524231, 0.99692922830581